        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "words": 22,
      "text": "This sustenance of various kinds that people gather in and eat, and enters the body; it shall be distributed to five productions.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
        "has_bridge_connective": false,
        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "words": 30,
      "text": "The first product is this that shall issue from the person in rapture and rises up in the Mind, and it comes out from all his limbs, and is immeasurable.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
        "has_bridge_connective": false,
        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "words": 14,
      "text": "The second is this that shall issue from the person in voice and word.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
        "has_bridge_connective": false,
        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "words": 13,
      "text": "The third is this that shall spring from them in strength and activity.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
        "has_bridge_connective": false,
        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "words": 15,
      "text": "The fourth is what is engendered by the pleasure of lu[s]t in men and women.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
        "has_bridge_connective": false,
        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "words": 69,
      "text": "The fifth is this that shall be formed and sculpted in the flesh, and be engendered and come from them. It is this corporeal creature; only its parents can recognise this creature that they beget. They are attentive to its desire and its thought and its [lo]ve every day, all the time. However, these other four forms they neither notice nor are concerned about; because they are not displayed.",
      "scores": {
